### Simple endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Greeting with path variable
GET http://localhost:8080/greet/World

### Slow operation (500ms)
GET http://localhost:8080/slow

### Kafka - Send simple message
POST http://localhost:8080/kafka/send?message=Hello Kafka!!!!

### Kafka - Send message with key
POST http://localhost:8080/kafka/send-with-key?key=test-key&message=Hello with key!